WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.900
Two adults request a relaxed Kyoto itinerary for 1–3 February 2027.
with an interest in temples and gardens.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The host proposes three days with two main places per day.
leaving time for lunch and breaks.

3
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The user confirms the itinerary and asks for a travel journal with a map.

4
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:47.000
The host prepares the confirmed itinerary for JourniOne.

5
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:56.000
The real Create travel journal call is visible.
The request is accepted and generation continues asynchronously.

6
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
The newly generated preview opens while content is still being completed.

7
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:13.000
The generation log shows which artifacts have been saved
and which are still being generated.

8
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:24.000
The preview shows itinerary cards alongside the map.

9
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.000
The cover and illustrated travel journal appear.

10
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:50.600
The user explores the illustrated journal and real place details.
including photos and source links.
